---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Editorial Policy | Isaya Muunganisha Wachumba">
  <div class="container" style="padding:56px 0;max-width:820px;">
    <p class="muted">EDITORIAL POLICY</p>
    <h1>Editorial Policy</h1>
    <p style="line-height:1.8;">Isaya inalenga kuchapisha maudhui yenye usahihi, context na uwazi. Taarifa muhimu zinapaswa kuthibitishwa kwa vyanzo vinavyofaa kabla ya kuchapishwa.</p>
    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.8;">Tunapogundua kosa la ukweli, tunalirekebisha kwa uwazi na, inapofaa, kueleza kilichorekebishwa.</p>
    <h2>AI na teknolojia</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.8;">Teknolojia za AI zinaweza kutumika kusaidia production workflow, lakini maudhui ya habari yanapaswa kupitia editorial review na fact-checking kabla ya kuchapishwa.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
